# Dependencies and build output
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/

# CREDENTIALS. The Cognigy endpoint URL token is all anyone needs to talk to the agent and
# spend the LLM budget. Never commit these, especially to a public repository.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Operational record of the live Cognigy deployment: NiCE tenant, project, agent, flow and
# LLM identifiers. Deliberately kept local. Tenant identifiers are confidential and must not
# be published.
cognigy/deployed.md

# Machine-specific: contains absolute paths to the local Node install, so it is wrong for
# anyone else and would break their preview.
.claude/

# Demo media lives outside this directory in ../Resources and is NOT part of this repo.
# The videos are NiCE marketing assets that have not been approved for external distribution.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm

# OS and OneDrive noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# The generated deck and its PDF. Deliberately NOT committed, even though the generator is.
#
# The .pptx is built on NiCE's corporate PowerPoint template, so it embeds the slide master,
# 32 layouts and 34 media files from it. This repository is public, and publishing internal
# corporate template artwork is not ours to do. The deck also discusses content that is not
# yet approved for external use, and open security questions.
#
# tools/deck rebuilds it in seconds from the template on your machine, so nothing is lost.
docs/*.pptx
docs/*.pdf